  "description": "Details of car park management plan (condition 6), construction management and logistics plan (condition 7), cycle parking (condition 10) submitted pursuant to planning permission 00094/AP/P1 dated 13/01/2017 for proposed new build single storey Pupil Referral Unit (PRU) primary SEN School for 30 pupils year age 4-11. The proposal comprised of Early Years, Key Stage1 and Key stage 2 classrooms, learning & support facilities for pupils and staffs, Multi-purpose hall, storages, Plant room and server room. Proposed 2.4m high anti-climb fencing all around site with sliding metal gate for vehicular access and secured metal gates for pedestrian access/exit, basketball court with basketball hoops & 5.2m metal fencing all around the court, detached roof canopy of 50sqm covered area at rear & proposed car park area on front."
